Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.96,0:00:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Open, Sesame!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.81,0:02:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There! Get this! Come on! Hold it! Well?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.49,0:02:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three...{一二三hi fu mi is an old way to count 123}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.45,0:02:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.37,0:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.56,0:02:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! And you! {kono sono?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.78,0:02:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing, O King?! {??????}{original TL good enough, sounds like なななな何を？！}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.26,0:02:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, Chief. Your face looks funny, \Nno matter how many times I see it. {keisatsu shochou / 警察署長 = chief of police}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.16,0:03:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, i-it is an honor, Your Majesty Ali Baba XXXIII. \NAh, but Your Majesty's skill truly is magnificent!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.69,0:03:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this morning, you've popped 3,333 balloons!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.19,0:03:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to that, I'm starving.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.19,0:03:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chef, bring me my meal!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.32,0:03:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! Coming! {this is just haihai followed by random 'funny' sounds, very common in old media}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.57,0:03:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I got tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.16,0:03:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.04,0:03:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Here you go, kitty-cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.17,0:03:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pork bun! {butaman = steamed bun with minced pork filling}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.94,0:03:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Pork bun...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.35,0:03:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, where's {\i1}my{\i0} feast?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.01,0:03:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Inside the cat's mouth, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.91,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Then you mean that was...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.20,0:03:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All there was. {lit: you too... have no more}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.76,0:03:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.75,0:03:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I'm the king. \NI have the right to eat my fill of delicious food!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... But... {moshikashi?}{ano, sikashi}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.25,Overlap,,0,0,0,,You're the Head Chef! {gonna put in a disclaimer here for the rest of the movie and say that the audio quality is abysmal dogshit}{sounds like コック長 to me}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.25,0:03:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me mountains of good food!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.39,0:04:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, there's something \Nwe must discuss about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.14,0:04:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up please, Sesamehameha! {goma-chan - sesame-chan}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.54,0:04:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"Open, Sesame!" is how you say it, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.95,0:04:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This great treasury sure feels awfully empty.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.39,0:04:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, this underground treasury
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.30,0:04:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,was once packed full of treasure plundered \Nby Ali Baba I after he defeated forty thieves.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.99,0:04:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,These dents in the floor \Nare where piles of gold coins used to sit.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.65,0:04:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Around here were diamonds, over there rubies, {whatever that last word is; that black nondescript pile we see isn't making it any easier}{it's likely ruby ルビー }
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.01,0:04:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and this corner was packed with sapphires.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.00,0:04:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But by the time of Your Majesty's father, \Nhalf the treasury was already empty.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And the other half?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.36,0:04:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty spent every last bit of it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's no money left in the castle?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.72,0:05:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,None at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.32,0:05:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, the only thing Your Majesty \Nhas left to his name is this dirty old lamp.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.60,0:05:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Filthy!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.52,0:05:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, not even a junk dealer would take this thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.15,0:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.13,0:05:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the interruption!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.49,0:05:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's a ghost! Help! {deta?}{出た！助けて！deta (showed up, appeared) is a common word used when a ghost, well, shows up}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.93,0:05:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me those looks. \NI'm only the spirit of the lamp.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.52,0:05:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The spirit of the lamp? Then are you \Nthe Lamp Genie I've heard rumors about?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.97,0:05:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.30,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.50,0:05:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.53,0:05:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please command me however you wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.72,0:05:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, wonderful! I think I can count on you. \NYour very first order is to bring me a feast at once!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.52,0:05:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,An easy task!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.81,0:05:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! And don't forget to bring a few bonito flakes too!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.61,0:06:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonito flakes? What for?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.28,0:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,For me to eat...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.23,0:06:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Awful! I hate it! I just hate it! {kirai? hate?}{yes, sounds just like kirai ad nauseum}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate it! Hate it! Hate it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.02,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Come back! What's wrong, Genie? \NCome out now. Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.38,0:06:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But I hate cats! \NIf there's even one cat around, I can't work!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.39,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate it! Hate it! Hate it! Hate it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.12,0:06:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Why are you hiding? {?????}{やだーんかくれちゃいやーん}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.92,0:06:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If there are cats around, he can't bring me my feast. \NChief, get rid of every cat in the kingdom!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.60,0:06:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, we'll lock up this kitten too!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.03,0:06:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Close it up, won't you, Sesamehameha?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.07,0:06:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"Close, Sesame!" is how you say it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.79,0:07:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.23,0:07:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can escape?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.97,0:07:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Caught another one here!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.18,0:07:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Give that cat here!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.97,0:07:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No more cats! {????????}{this one is too muffled, sorry}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let them go! {?????}{離して！}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.90,0:07:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock it off! \NWhy the hell are you doing something so cruel?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.90,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't get in our way, boy!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.08,0:07:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Such are the orders of His Majesty Ali Baba, \Nyou little beggar! {???????}{この乞食坊主！}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.26,0:07:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kazil!{kajiru - I think kazil sounds arabic enough as a translation for this; in the official (?) translation they call him "Nibbler" because kajiru means "to gnaw; to nibble"; I have never read the original Ali Baba, but I don't think such a character was there}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.20,0:07:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! We've captured \Nevery single cat in the kingdom!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.80,0:08:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work. You're a capable servant.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.96,0:08:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then... Genie dear, come on out now. {mamono-chan}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.39,0:08:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Eh? Eh? Um... Um... Um... \NWait, what about the cats?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.97,0:08:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. They're gone now.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.76,0:08:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as there aren't any cats around...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the best there is! {?????}{張り切っちゃうだもんね！original TL is good enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.76,0:08:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy. Now bring me mountains of delicious food.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.76,0:08:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then excuse me while I go fetch it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.12,0:08:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can have anything I desire. \NMy future is looking bright!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.80,0:08:47.53,Top,,0,0,0,,Pork buns! Horse buns! Get them here!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.89,0:08:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.18,0:08:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, come near! Hot fresh dumplings right here! {odango}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.37,0:08:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some dumplings?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.68,0:09:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come one, come all! Sweet watermelons! \NThey'll melt on your tongue! Delicious watermelons!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, nice and sweet!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.87,0:09:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, have some! Sweet watermelons!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.35,0:09:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have one!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.10,0:09:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, certainly.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.10,0:09:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's all?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.86,0:09:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.91,0:09:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.90,0:09:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.38,0:09:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh cane bread! Huh? {???????}{this one's also too muffled sorry}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.51,0:09:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I carry this much, \Nthat'll certainly make for a feast!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.12,0:09:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.81,0:09:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? U-Um? What the...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.53,0:09:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of dish are you planning to turn me into?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.82,0:09:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! A cat!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.06,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that guy's problem?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.74,0:10:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! There are still cats out there?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.84,0:10:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup! And especially nasty-looking ones too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.44,0:10:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.32,0:10:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sire?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.69,0:10:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't capture every last one this time, you're fired!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.78,0:10:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sire!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.53,0:10:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy! Step right up!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.19,0:10:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're calling us.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.21,0:10:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.53,0:10:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap! They got me... {あれ捕まえた～}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.09,0:10:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go! Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.03,0:10:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.06,0:10:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just need to climb this... and this... {ほいっと、よっこらしょ、ほい、ほい - again this is mostly just random noises}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.04,0:10:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A complete success! \NThis time we've captured every last cat for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.82,0:11:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody! Run for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.24,0:11:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Chase after the cats! \NDon't let them escape! Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.29,0:11:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.68,0:11:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are such good kitties for not trying to run away.{お前たち逃げないのね、いい子ちゃんね～　TL good enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.36,0:11:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's too spoiled for thinking that. Hey, Goro.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.27,0:11:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Boss, if you say so,\NI'll go ahead and rip him apart! {oyabun = yakuza boss}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.92,0:11:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look here!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.40,0:11:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then. Take care now.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.82,0:11:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.86,0:11:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! {given the context might be doaho/idiot, but too muffled - should be good as it is though}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.77,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.80,0:11:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cretin!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.24,0:11:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Halfwit! Klutz!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.76,0:11:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.72,0:11:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Subhuman! {third-rate?}{yes, third rate - sanryuu 三流}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.83,0:11:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.84,0:11:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Good-for-nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.65,0:12:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.06,0:12:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sorry" won't cut it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.56,0:12:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you ashamed that they freed the cats?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.43,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.54,0:12:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go catch that brat and those cats!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.75,0:12:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you say so, \Nwe have no idea where they went.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.25,0:12:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Chief, you're completely useless!\N You're the worst!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.55,0:12:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't rely on you anymore!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.09,0:12:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear, come out for a moment. {mamono-chan}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.18,0:12:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master. What do you require?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.36,0:12:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Genie, couldn't you use your magic powers \Nto find where that brat Huck is hiding? {hakku = al huck}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.85,0:12:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding missing people is easy. Excuse me a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.62,0:12:39.05,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't touch that!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.05,0:12:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm! Smells good.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.14,0:12:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When I concentrate my mind, \NI can see anywhere in the world inside this lamp.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.80,0:13:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Abamacho Kamachora Pinneko Areruru Donchurara...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.93,0:13:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it. I see it...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.28,0:13:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.42,0:13:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A deep forest.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Huck must be hiding in the forest!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.11,0:13:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I concentrate even harder...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.66,0:13:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.97,0:13:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see it! A mountain cabin.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.78,0:13:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Huck's hideout!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.70,0:13:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If I concentrate with all my might...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.68,0:13:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate cats!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.33,0:14:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me, men!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.66,0:14:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... pleased to meetcha! {ohikaenosutte = yakuza greeting; please allow me to introduce myself}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.96,0:14:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd allow me to introduce myself...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.74,0:14:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, no need for all that.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.14,0:14:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You act like that, and people'll stop liking you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.55,0:14:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya think so?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.18,0:14:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me try again. \NI'm Dora, the alley cat. All the other cats call me...{????}{doraneko = stray/street cat}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.08,0:14:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.82,0:14:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, and this here is...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.25,0:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Goro, at your service.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.41,0:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The thirty-eight of us here today owe you big time \Nfor saving us from danger. All right, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.28,0:14:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.55,0:14:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.99,0:14:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huck! Huck! It's terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.22,0:14:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Kazil? What's going on in town?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.06,0:14:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Big news! They've put a bounty on your head.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.71,0:14:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A bounty on me?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.84,0:15:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.88,0:15:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,These posters are plastered all over town.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.64,0:15:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"Real name: Al Huck
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.40,0:15:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A big time criminal who defied \Nthe king's orders and freed the cats.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.88,0:15:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever captures him will receive \Nten gold coins. Ali Baba XXXIII."
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.76,0:15:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Rats. That makes our friend here an outlaw. {was: fugitive from justice, a little swanky for a yakuza cat; lit, wanted person}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.41,0:15:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, for helping us, Huck's been...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.49,0:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.86,0:15:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.78,0:15:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading out, everybody!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.43,0:15:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.40,0:15:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up! Heading where?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.25,0:15:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious? We're gonna sneak into Ali Baba's castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.83,0:15:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Th-That's no joke! \NYou're basically just turning yourselves in! {???}{捕まりにいくようなもんだぜ？！}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind already.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.49,0:15:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dat's right! \NAfter all, we've got our pride as cats to uphold.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.90,0:15:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.22,0:15:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If cats have their pride as cats, \Nthen I've got my pride as a human boy!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.81,0:15:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No way I'm handing over someone \NI already saved back to the enemy!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.65,0:15:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare you to try and get past me!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.86,0:16:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all calm down! {wait, wait}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.11,0:16:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,These cats are remarkably ballsy for this day and age.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.79,0:16:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And I rather like the number thirty-eight.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.88,0:16:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.53,0:16:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight cats, plus you and me, makes exactly forty.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.54,0:16:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.47,0:16:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Huck{-sama}, from this day forward,\N you must fight against Ali Baba.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.13,0:16:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.98,0:16:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've kept silent until now, but you and Ali Baba \Nwere destined to clash someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.66,0:16:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.73,0:16:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to tell you. \NThe tale of Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves. {here it's still yon juu nin = 40 people of thieves (not small animals)}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.47,0:16:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.49,0:16:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen carefully, Lord Huck.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.34,0:17:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To your secret... and the truth of your birth.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.47,0:17:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, there lived a man named Ali Baba.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.96,0:17:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He was poor, and every day he went \Ninto the forest gathering firewood to survive.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.31,0:17:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But one day, while gathering firewood, \Nhe saw forty thieves passing by.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.95,0:17:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When the thieves reached a giant rock, their leader shouted:
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.78,0:17:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"Open, Sesame!"{same joke as in Tezuka Osamu's Arabian Nights"}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.46,0:17:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, as if by magic, a huge cave suddenly appeared.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.94,0:17:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the thieves finished carrying \Ntheir stolen booty into the cave, eventually...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.43,0:17:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"Close, Sesame!"
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.86,0:17:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The entrance was sealed behind\N the rock once again, and they left.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.43,0:17:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ali Baba had secretly watched the whole thing,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.85,0:18:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so he repeated what the thieves' leader had said\Nand opened the rock to go inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.40,0:18:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing! It's packed full of treasure! I'm taking some!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.63,0:18:15.87,Song,,0,0,0,,What an outrage — heh-hoh-hoh!{これは！呆れた! - original TL (though from the third part) is good}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.87,0:18:19.85,Song,,0,0,0,,The thieves — heh! Stole it — hup!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.85,0:18:23.15,Song,,0,0,0,,But then Ali Baba re-stole the stolen gold — hup!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.15,0:18:27.13,Song,,0,0,0,,What a terrible Ali Baba!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.14,0:18:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.19,0:18:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So we finally found them. Surround that cabin!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.05,0:18:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And as it happens, the thieves' leader's name was Al Huck.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.66,0:18:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's the same name as me!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.66,0:18:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That is exactly why you must listen carefully, Lord Huck.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.19,0:18:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.58,0:19:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, the thieves' leader learned\N that the treasure had been stolen.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.49,0:19:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So the leader secretly sent his men into town \Nto find out who had swiped the treasure.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.31,0:19:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ali Baba?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.36,0:19:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, the leader discovered that Ali Baba \Nwas the one who had stolen the treasure.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.46,0:19:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So he prepared forty jars \Nand hid his men inside them.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.05,0:19:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up. The moment I give the signal, \Njump out and kill Ali Baba.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.46,0:19:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After arranging everything, \Nthe leader disguised himself as an oil merchant.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.38,0:19:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a traveling oil merchant. \NPlease let me stay the night.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.40,0:19:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The thieves' leader successfully slipped into Ali Baba's mansion,\N together with the jars hiding his men.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.95,0:19:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Ali Baba's clever servant \Nnoticed the thieves inside the jars.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.81,0:19:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible! I've got to do something!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.43,0:20:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The servant poured boiling oil into the jars\N and killed every last thief.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.55,0:20:03.97,Song,,0,0,0,,What a cruel trick — heh-hoh-hoh!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.97,0:20:07.78,Song,,0,0,0,,The thieves — heh! Came to kill — hup!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.78,0:20:11.31,Song,,0,0,0,,But Ali Baba killed them instead — hup!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.31,0:20:15.44,Song,,0,0,0,,What a terrible Ali Baba!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.57,0:20:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Get 'em!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.57,0:20:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.66,0:20:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.96,0:20:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, if you'd let me continue, Lord Huck.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.46,0:20:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The sad secret... and the bitter ending.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.96,0:20:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The thieves' leader barely escaped with his life.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.96,0:20:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So next time, he disguised himself \Nalone as a jewel merchant...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.33,0:20:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a traveling jeweler.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.49,0:20:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to sell you fine jewels at low prices.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.22,0:20:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ali Baba happily fell for the thief leader's invitation
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.25,0:20:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and welcomed the jeweler into his hall for a feast.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.28,0:21:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As the jeweler sat beside Ali Baba and ate, \Nhe waited for the perfect chance to kill him.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.79,0:21:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But then that clever servant saw through him.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy my dance.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.35,0:21:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,While performing a sword dance, \Nthe servant plunged a blade into the jeweler's chest!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.34,0:21:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And so Ali Baba defeated the thieves' leader, claimed all the thieves'\N treasure for himself, and eventually became King Ali Baba.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.75,0:21:35.86,Song,,0,0,0,,What an outrage — heh-hoh-hoh!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.86,0:21:39.53,Song,,0,0,0,,He stole — heh! From the thieves — hup!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.53,0:21:42.86,Song,,0,0,0,,Hogged it all to himself, Ali Baba! Hup!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.86,0:21:47.31,Song,,0,0,0,,That awful Ali Baba!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.04,0:21:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And that Ali Baba is the ancestor of today's Ali Baba XXXIII.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.07,0:21:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's that got to do with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.57,0:22:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Huck, please listen carefully. \NYou are yourself the descendant of the thieves' leader of old.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:01.56,0:22:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.74,0:22:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell the truth, I am from a family of mice that has lived \Nfor generations in the attic of the Al Huck household.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:10.74,0:22:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.41,0:22:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is getting interesting!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.35,0:22:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Huck, now is the time to reclaim your ancestors' treasure!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.15,0:22:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:21.49,0:22:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Together with me and our thirty-eight thieving comrades here,\N we will become the new Forty Thieves! {and now it's yon juppiki = 40 small animal thieves - still don't see a way to reflect it in EN;}{can go with something like Forty Little Thieves, i think it's a good fit}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.03,0:22:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dat's right! Let's become Lord Huck's followers \Nand form the Forty Thieves! {small animal}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.64,0:22:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it! {maybe "obviously"}{it is あったぼうよ}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.83,0:22:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That Ali Baba creep stole our friends too! \NWe're taking everything back all at once!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:38.46,0:22:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.68,0:22:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huck! I place you under arrest!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.54,0:22:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Though if you quietly hand over all of those alley cats \Nhiding with you, I might spare your life.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:55.96,0:22:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Huck?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.44,0:22:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw off! {shut up}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:58.90,0:23:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what dreadful language! \NIs that any way to speak to a king?!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.78,0:23:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Some king you are!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.35,0:23:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ancestor was just a cheapskate \Nwho stole the thieves' treasure!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:09.74,0:23:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr... Chief, wipe out every last one of them!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:13.76,0:23:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Charge! {??}{after the first yes just grunting i believe}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:21.48,0:23:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.53,0:23:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Perverts... {ecchi}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.57,0:23:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.87,0:23:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.90,0:23:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit them with everything you've got \Nwhen they run away from the fire! {accurate, 火に追われて飛び出してくるところをやっちゃうのよ！}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:48.79,0:23:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everybody! I'll break through first. \NYou guys follow right behind me!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.08,0:23:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And after that?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.51,0:23:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get separated, let's meet three nights from now \Nunder the full moon at the junkyard behind the market!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.51,0:24:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The junkyard on the night of the full moon?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.47,0:24:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The password is Al Huck...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.19,0:24:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Forty. {yes, without "thieves"}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.50,0:24:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood! {????????}{correct, just yakuza speak わかりやした}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.43,0:24:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, be careful!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.15,0:24:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Huck.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.47,0:24:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.82,0:24:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You little! Get back here!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.12,0:24:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,After them! {/don't let them escape}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:29.75,0:24:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:31.95,0:24:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch them all!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:36.41,0:24:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:38.21,0:24:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:47.05,0:24:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that bastard Ali Baba!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.84,0:24:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually smoked us out \Nof the shack we called home!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:53.03,0:24:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, we'll drive you out of your castle for good!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:58.77,0:25:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One-and-two-and-three-and-four, \Ntwo-and-two-and-three-and-four...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.44,0:25:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-and-two-and-three-and-four, \Nand four-four-four-four...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:06.12,0:25:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, are you awake?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:08.64,0:25:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's my dear Chief! Good morning. {-kun}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:10.64,0:25:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? To be addressed so affectionately!\N That's more honor than I deserve! {lit: you called me with -kun}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:14.69,0:25:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in excellent spirits this morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:16.33,0:25:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally. Last night we gave Huck and those cats \Na thorough beating, so I slept wonderfully.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:23.59,0:25:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And regarding that, I have even better news.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:27.22,0:25:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? I want to hear it.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:28.94,0:25:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Huck and the cats \Nhave fled to some distant land.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:32.99,0:25:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:33.81,0:25:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We've searched the entire kingdom from top to bottom\N since this morning, but there's no trace of them anywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:38.64,0:25:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely excellent!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:40.42,0:25:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But keep up the guard patrols.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.16,0:25:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.94,0:25:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, right away—
Dialogue: 10,0:25:44.17,0:25:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear! {-chan}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:46.15,0:25:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out now!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:48.20,0:25:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:50.70,0:25:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:55.24,0:25:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me the finest clothes and the finest feast!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:58.22,0:26:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And the cats are gone now, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:00.59,0:26:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't even a single stuffed cat left in this kingdom!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:03.50,0:26:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful! I've got a new lease on life! Off I go!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:16.89,0:26:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come one, come all...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:19.64,0:26:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Finest carpets... {????}{heard a 絨毯 jutan there}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:34.73,0:26:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Smell ya later!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:43.63,0:26:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Damn it, what a thieving...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:48.22,0:26:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How... Hum!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:49.76,0:26:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly... he-he.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.32,0:26:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.97,0:26:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty's happiness is the people's happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:55.62,0:26:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendidly said!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:56.87,0:27:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, to commemorate my happiness, \NI will erect statues of myself all across the kingdom.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:01.98,0:27:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Another excellent idea indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:05.24,0:27:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear, decorate all the town squares with statues of me!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:09.50,0:27:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:20.21,0:27:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:23.33,0:27:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:27.00,0:27:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:30.59,0:27:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:34.14,0:27:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't get enough, can you? {??? maybe "that's for acting like an idiot"}　{it's 阿漕な真似しくさって！ but as the idea remains the same (he's chastising Ali Baba for being so full of himself) I feel this is a good enough TL}
Dialogue: 10,0:27:37.51,0:27:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:39.81,0:27:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the way!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:47.90,0:27:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow ow ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:49.67,0:27:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:51.30,0:27:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Huck, please bear it for now.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:53.54,0:27:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:55.03,0:27:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:55.98,0:27:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But Kazil...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:57.11,0:27:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear it! You must bear it!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:11.92,0:28:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just until tonight, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:14.82,0:28:16.68,Thought,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:37.70,0:28:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The security sure is tight.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:39.41,0:28:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:43.79,0:28:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we get inside?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:45.55,0:28:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have prepared something for this very day, Lord Huck.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:49.26,0:28:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:54.59,0:28:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:55.56,0:28:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:00.39,0:29:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Huck, this rug is the world-famous flying carpet itself.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:05.83,0:29:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:06.64,0:29:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, it once belonged to the original Lord Huck.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:09.75,0:29:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was one of the treasures.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:11.46,0:29:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Right before Ali Baba robbed us, my ancestors somehow hid it away and passed it down to this very day.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:16.98,0:29:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,With this carpet, crossing lakes is nothing at all! {? i guess because Ali Baba's castle is in the middle of the lake?}{yes, just making the point this will make getting to the castle very easy}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:20.71,0:29:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kazil!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:40.24,0:29:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, the password!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:46.60,0:29:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:47.79,0:29:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Al Huck...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:49.39,0:29:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Forty!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:52.98,0:29:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's roll! {yare?}{just warcries, but this is fine}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:55.15,0:29:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:56.48,0:29:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Huck... {hakku no oyabun = boss huck}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:58.22,0:29:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...all thirty-eight of us...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:59.90,0:30:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...are here now!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:01.34,0:30:02.62,Song,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:05.62,0:30:12.67,Song,,0,0,0,,For this very day, we've sharpened our claws and waited! {obviously the inserts from this aren't anywhere else on the internet but by some miracle I found this: https://aucview.aucfan.com/yahoo/b1102503685/ - though the picture is still shitty quality; この日のために ツメをといで 待っていたー おれたち三十八郎! アリババから宝をうばいかえそう！\N}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:12.67,0:30:15.21,Song,,0,0,0,,We are the Thirty-Eight!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:15.21,0:30:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:16.18,0:30:24.24,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's steal back the treasure from Ali Baba!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:24.24,0:30:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I gotta pee!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:26.47,0:30:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true. We've gathered here to reclaim the treasure \NAli Baba stole from my ancestor.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:32.23,0:30:39.62,Song,,0,0,0,,For this very day, we've sharpened our fangs and laid low! {この日のために 牙を研いで ひそんでいた俺たち三十八匹! アリババから仲間を奪い返そう!\N}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:39.62,0:30:43.08,Song,,0,0,0,,We are the Thirty-Eight!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:43.08,0:30:51.45,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's rescue our comrades from Ali Baba! {other cats ig?}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:51.45,0:30:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:52.30,0:30:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, you all gathered to save your fellow cats, \Nbut... now I've realized something!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:59.65,0:31:04.32,Song,,0,0,0,,There is something far, far more important! {もっともっと大事なことがある 宝を奪い返すよりも仲間を奪い返すよりも もっともっと大切なことがある それはこの国の誰もが アリババから奪い取られた幸せを 幸せを奪い返すことだ\N}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:04.80,0:31:09.91,Song,,0,0,0,,More important than taking back treasure! \NMore important than rescuing our comrades!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:09.91,0:31:15.14,Song,,0,0,0,,Something far more important than all of that!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:15.14,0:31:26.22,Song,,0,0,0,,We must take back the happiness that Ali Baba stole\N from every single person in this kingdom!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:27.38,0:31:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said, Lord Huck! That's exactly\N what the leader of the Forty Thieves {\i1}should{\i0} say!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:33.39,0:31:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, we might as well go bigger than that! {ハックの親分、ここはひとつぐんと欲張ろうじゃないですか！}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:36.37,0:31:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:37.12,0:31:42.99,Song,,0,0,0,,The stolen treasure and our stolen friends—\NThe stolen happiness too {うばわれた宝も仲間も\Nうばわれたシアワセも \N一つのこらず\Nとり　もど　そう　そう　そう　そう！！\Nこの日のためにツメをといで\N待っていた	盗賊四十郎！\Nアリババからすべてをうばいかえそう!\N}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:42.99,0:31:44.42,Song,,0,0,0,,We'll take back
Dialogue: 10,0:31:44.42,0:31:47.10,Song,,0,0,0,,Every single thing
Dialogue: 10,0:31:47.10,0:31:48.62,Song,,0,0,0,,And more!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:48.62,0:31:51.31,Song,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:50.39,0:31:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:51.31,0:31:56.23,Song,,0,0,0,,For this very day we've sharpened our claws
Dialogue: 10,0:31:56.81,0:32:01.36,Song,,0,0,0,,And waited, Forty Thieves!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:01.82,0:32:13.16,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's steal back everything from Ali Baba!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:18.50,0:32:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:21.26,0:32:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. We'll fly over on this flying carpet.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:23.63,0:32:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? So we're gonna fly through the sky \Non this thing and sneak into the castle?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:26.63,0:32:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. They'd never expect us to come from the sky.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:29.95,0:32:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:31.14,0:32:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's one incredible secret weapon.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:33.08,0:32:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let us ride too!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:34.29,0:32:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:39.04,0:32:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? This carpet seems like\N it doesn't want cats riding on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:42.49,0:32:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bucking us off!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:43.86,0:32:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:49.99,0:32:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:51.22,0:32:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all just jump on it, boss.\N We're riding it no matter what!{こうなったら意地だっせ親分！何が何でも乗ったらまがいなん！ might have butchered the spelling for the last 2 seconds (yakuza speak) but meaning should be accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:56.17,0:32:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody! Ready...
Dialogue: 10,0:33:05.97,0:33:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get back, carpet! We {\i1}need{\i0} to go back!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:09.47,0:33:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no wonder he rebelled \Nwhen the cats that he hates tried to ride it. {just like the genie}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:13.62,0:33:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Calm down! {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:25.48,0:33:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away! Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:26.77,0:33:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! Stop it, you hear?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:54.64,0:33:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, men! Tonight, to celebrate \Nthe installation of 3,333 statues
Dialogue: 10,0:33:59.29,0:34:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,of His Majesty Ali Baba XXXIII throughout the country,\N we'll hold a grand party!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:05.19,0:34:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear your cheers of adoration for His Highness!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:08.48,0:34:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo!{seems like a mix of bravo banzai and probably something else, good enough as it is}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:09.88,0:34:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful! Only tonight, \Nyou can eat as much as you want!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:12.77,0:34:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:14.24,0:34:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all raise a toast to His Majesty!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:18.26,0:34:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll take the lead.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:20.96,0:34:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:25.33,0:34:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:29.26,0:34:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ali Baba!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:30.97,0:34:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Swanky! {kakkoii = cool ?}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:32.57,0:34:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're still around?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:34.47,0:34:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph! I've come to take this castle back!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:37.47,0:34:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? And what makes you think\N this castle belongs to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:40.48,0:34:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it does!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:41.64,0:34:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ancestor stole the thieves' treasure\N and built this castle with it!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:45.27,0:34:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Huck here is the descendant of the thieves' leader!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:48.61,0:34:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:49.73,0:34:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ali Baba dynasty didn't just keep \Nthe Al Huck treasure only for themselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:53.74,0:34:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They stole the happiness of the people\N in this kingdom too!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:56.63,0:34:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And the cats as well!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:59.04,0:35:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! And we're taking it all back together!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:01.50,0:35:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get carried away, you filthy brat! All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:05.00,0:35:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:06.44,0:35:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Genie dear, come on out! This is urgent!{大至急よん！}
Dialogue: 10,0:35:09.75,0:35:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes? What do you need?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:13.02,0:35:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I want you to give Huck a good thrashing!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:15.06,0:35:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:15.83,0:35:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing simpler.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:23.31,0:35:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm going to enjoy this. \NYou can thrash him as much as you like! {う～楽しみ！好きなだけいたぶってやんのよん！}
Dialogue: 10,0:35:30.45,0:35:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one with magic! {as in magical carpet to fight the magical genie}
Dialogue: 10,0:35:36.20,0:35:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Huck unleashes the first attack,
Dialogue: 10,0:35:38.48,0:35:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the Long Ear Strategy! {mi mi mi mi = ear ear ear ear operation}
Dialogue: 10,0:35:41.49,0:35:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:43.34,0:35:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:44.94,0:35:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:49.98,0:35:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:50.96,0:35:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! This isn't good!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:54.18,0:35:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:56.30,0:35:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Oh, my.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:00.89,0:36:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Lord Huck!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:02.02,0:36:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I needed!{ほいした！ - good enough tl}
Dialogue: 10,0:36:05.56,0:36:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And now comes the terrifying second attack, \Nthe Great Achoo Strategy!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:11.78,0:36:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Achooooo!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:15.87,0:36:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:17.94,0:36:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:34.43,0:36:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Quit dawdling and climb aboard already!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:37.09,0:36:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But Boss, ya sure dis busted thing's really safe?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:41.60,0:36:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah! Believe in my genius inventing skills!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:44.60,0:36:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I snip this rope, we'll go shooting off \Nstraight for the island! Here I go!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:53.25,0:36:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this, Goro?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:54.21,0:36:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Boss, this truly is an incredible invention!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:56.61,0:36:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, naturally.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:59.62,0:37:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Thirty-three meters to the castle! \NPrepare to land! Everybody make scary faces!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:09.92,0:37:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... thirty-three centimeters left.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:12.38,0:37:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there! Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:19.55,0:37:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear, make sure you pamper little Huck{-chan} plenty.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:27.83,0:37:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! {tasukete}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:31.86,0:37:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear, rough him up good!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:34.61,0:37:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:37.41,0:37:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dang it all!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:40.41,0:37:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And... whoops!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:51.99,0:37:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You caught one! {alligator}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:56.59,0:37:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And... whoops!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:02.41,0:38:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, you crook... {chikusho?}{yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:09.26,0:38:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:14.28,0:38:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:16.20,0:38:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear, the gators are getting impatient, \Nso you may let them eat him now! {wani-chan}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:20.42,0:38:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:22.09,0:38:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, whoops!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:23.69,0:38:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Huck! I believe in you!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:27.58,0:38:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go, go, go!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:31.37,0:38:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go, go, go!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:41.18,0:38:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:41.99,0:38:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Huh? Wh-What are y—
Dialogue: 10,0:38:46.27,0:38:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bleh.{?}{sound of sticking tongue out}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:47.97,0:38:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bop. {pon = sfx of tapping sometihng lightly}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:53.67,0:38:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, keep it steady!　{足を踏ん張る is less 'kicking hard' and more 'keeping steady'}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:56.32,0:38:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is gonna be okay, right, Boss?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:59.03,0:39:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust me!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:05.32,0:39:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! This is awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:08.41,0:39:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great success.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:13.21,0:39:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, what? No!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:16.58,0:39:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A mere 33 cm short again!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:21.25,0:39:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you lamp freak! {??}{good enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:39:22.88,0:39:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so tough, try catching us!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:25.41,0:39:29.12,Top,,0,0,0,,Catch him! Hurry! Fly! After them!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:25.41,0:39:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me! I can fly too!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:29.12,0:39:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:33.33,0:39:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:38.86,0:39:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:41.13,0:39:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:45.74,0:39:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear, what are you doing?! \NHurry up and catch them!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:50.75,0:39:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:58.84,0:40:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:00.25,0:40:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:02.88,0:40:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!{maybe "idiot" or "stop"}{either that or leave it empty, it's one of those random noises}
Dialogue: 10,0:40:12.60,0:40:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear, wipe them out!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:18.23,0:40:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, now I'm really mad! Seriously!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:22.67,0:40:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Give that back! {?????}{good enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:40:24.07,0:40:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:37.25,0:40:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Over here, stupid!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:56.27,0:40:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:58.98,0:41:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear! You can do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:13.50,0:41:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:17.56,0:41:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:21.92,0:41:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Kazil! The carpet's acting weird!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:25.30,0:41:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The carpet's worn out and exhausted! This is bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:34.97,0:41:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo! That did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:46.20,0:41:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Found him! What an idiot.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:50.28,0:41:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that? He's not here! Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:55.79,0:41:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Found him!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:01.74,0:42:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You little!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:03.17,0:42:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 10,0:42:07.05,0:42:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? What?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:13.14,0:42:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:13.91,0:42:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:16.60,0:42:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are! Found you!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:17.58,0:42:19.68,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Genie dear!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:19.68,0:42:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What on Earth are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:21.81,0:42:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I got him, all right? He's right here!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:25.79,0:42:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:29.24,0:42:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you little...
Dialogue: 10,0:42:47.62,0:42:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Water! Water.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:49.53,0:42:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Need something to drink. {あの、水くれ、水}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:01.73,0:43:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end! We're doomed!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:09.02,0:43:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! The Boss is gonna get eaten alive!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:12.57,0:43:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 10,0:43:14.03,0:43:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for our final trump card. \NThe Feeling Strategy! {/senses}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:18.33,0:43:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our favorite, catnip!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:21.97,0:43:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, we gotta hurry... huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:24.52,0:43:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this nice smell?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:26.98,0:43:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go! You can feel your bodies \Nget lighter! Lighter! Lighter!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:32.44,0:43:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You feel like a little bird now!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:35.46,0:43:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sounds wonderful...
Dialogue: 10,0:43:36.97,0:43:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa-ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:40.14,0:43:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly! Fly! Fly! Fly all the way to the castle!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:46.23,0:43:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Wait, don't eat him too quickly! \NI wanna torture him more first.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:51.00,0:43:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing...
Dialogue: 10,0:43:58.41,0:44:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Help! {good enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:44:01.37,0:44:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you run?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:03.14,0:44:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:04.37,0:44:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There. And there. There!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:07.71,0:44:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:08.36,0:44:12.51,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Lemme see! Lemme see! Lemme see! Please! Lemme see it!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:14.55,0:44:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:15.74,0:44:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:19.74,0:44:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You can begin!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:22.69,0:44:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There! There! And there!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:26.77,0:44:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:28.48,0:44:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:33.24,0:44:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There! Here! Right! Left! There! Kill him! There he goes!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:35.55,0:44:39.44,Overlap,,0,0,0,,There! There! There! Oh, there! And there!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:37.73,0:44:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Die! Die!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:41.70,0:44:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting {\i1}way{\i0} too into this. {getting carried away; going too far; overdoing}
Dialogue: 10,0:44:43.17,0:44:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:45.71,0:44:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:44:47.35,0:44:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Watch out! Careful, Huck!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:52.76,0:44:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you seem pretty worn out. Well then...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:08.58,0:45:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:24.44,0:45:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie dear, how long are you gonna chew him?!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:27.00,0:45:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Well, you see...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:30.08,0:45:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He got stuck between my teeth. Right here.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:32.98,0:45:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:37.00,0:45:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-What the...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:41.62,0:45:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! A cat!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:49.56,0:45:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:50.38,0:45:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having fun! Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:54.69,0:45:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:57.70,0:45:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:01.70,0:46:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Alley-oop...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:03.87,0:46:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:06.37,0:46:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! If the genie's gone, this is our chance! {lit: it's as good as if we won already}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:09.30,0:46:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You suddenly got energetic.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:11.33,0:46:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Ali Baba!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:13.17,0:46:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph! You clearly don't understand my power! \NVery well, I'll face you myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:17.72,0:46:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is! Surround him! {取り囲む is closer to surrounding}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:22.22,0:46:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing, Chief!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:25.10,0:46:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Huck, leave these losers to us!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:27.90,0:46:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Goro!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:28.90,0:46:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You go settle things with Ali Baba yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:31.48,0:46:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:32.58,0:46:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You little... {小癪な}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:39.11,0:46:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm! Not bad! {dekiru?}{yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:41.97,0:46:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief! I hope you're ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:45.72,0:46:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again! {また脱がす}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:47.00,0:46:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough! {もういや！}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:49.50,0:46:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:50.00,0:46:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:52.67,0:46:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! {just ’mateeei’、 good enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:47:22.62,0:47:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek! I hate cats!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:23.78,0:47:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:26.91,0:47:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you hack!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:30.99,0:47:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:32.50,0:47:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You! Huh? Hey, stop... Whoops. {just wanna let you know, I hate this movie with passion}{TL is fine, it's just a mix of wait/stop with random slapstick noises}
Dialogue: 10,0:47:36.30,0:47:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There I go!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:37.47,0:47:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:38.77,0:47:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:41.05,0:47:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, my lamp is just over there! {shimeta is a term used when things are going your way}
Dialogue: 10,0:47:44.60,0:47:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:49.22,0:47:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... you're fast. {あら、いらしたのね - literal would be 'oh, you're already there'}
Dialogue: 10,0:47:51.48,0:47:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop, you little...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:56.69,0:48:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm safe now! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:01.80,0:48:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:48:04.92,0:48:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna get inside this lamp\N so badly, go right ahead!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:07.37,0:48:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, well, you see...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:08.85,0:48:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not today! {also sound like nonsense, good enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:16.31,0:48:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:20.88,0:48:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:23.13,0:48:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to get back...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:24.21,0:48:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:29.22,0:48:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then... surrender!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:33.22,0:48:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Don't let go!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:35.23,0:48:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up, or I'll let go!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:37.12,0:48:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that? Heya!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:39.77,0:48:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:43.25,0:48:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:01.66,0:49:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You crook...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:13.26,0:49:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta go! Bye-bye! {/I'm going first}
Dialogue: 10,0:49:20.60,0:49:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate cats! Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:24.32,0:49:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here too?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:26.66,0:49:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared to death of cats, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:29.85,0:49:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hide in here! Open...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:31.74,0:49:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sesame! {no -chan}
Dialogue: 10,0:49:39.09,0:49:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh-uh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:42.51,0:49:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:51.57,0:49:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! {are?}{yeah, here 'what' is good enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:49:52.84,0:49:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go on any longer. \NOh, my! The stars are shining so coldly... {good enough - 冷たい星がキンキラキン}
Dialogue: 10,0:50:11.19,0:50:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:15.00,0:50:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:16.70,0:50:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Found him! Over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:18.66,0:50:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:20.10,0:50:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:21.64,0:50:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast! Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:25.15,0:50:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:26.51,0:50:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:28.00,0:50:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ali Baba!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:30.80,0:50:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up already!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:32.93,0:50:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, where's the treasure?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:35.27,0:50:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:36.85,0:50:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no treasure left.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:38.68,0:50:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:39.66,0:50:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,None?!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:40.55,0:50:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no way! {??? sonna aho na? that's too stupid to be true?}{good enough - it is indeed sonna aho na}
Dialogue: 10,0:50:41.86,0:50:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't even a single gold coin of that treasure left.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:48.61,0:50:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, excuse me for a sec.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:56.83,0:50:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:58.50,0:50:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:00.25,0:51:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:02.12,0:51:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly, fly, fly! Fly for me, carpet!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:07.05,0:51:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It flew! It's flying!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:09.50,0:51:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that crazy carpet! {???? }{クソ、イかれ絨毯め！}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:12.68,0:51:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huck, as long as this is mine, \Nyou'll never get me! {technically the translation is correct, but that's too literal - the idea is with the carpet he might just escape this and thus be on top of the conflict}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:17.51,0:51:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, smell ya later!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:19.47,0:51:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ali Baba, that carpet can't stay airborne much longer!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:24.01,0:51:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not falling for that! Bleh!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:31.36,0:51:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:45.18,0:51:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:16.57,0:52:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, back off! You can't be seen! \NHurry up and hide! Hide! Come on! {because then the genie will panic}
Dialogue: 10,0:52:21.33,0:52:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, if Lord Huck asks for a treasure, \Nwe're getting our cut too, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:25.69,0:52:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge cut!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:27.42,0:52:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll buy tons of fish and throw one flashy party!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:30.73,0:52:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,'Course we will!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:31.82,0:52:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:32.47,0:52:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For God's sake...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:33.34,0:52:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,These idiots, I swear...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:34.92,0:52:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, genie! Get out here!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:39.93,0:52:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly! Congratulations \Non your great victory, new Master!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:46.61,0:52:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such an opportunist, honestly.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:51.44,0:52:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've got a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:53.78,0:52:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you say!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:58.51,0:52:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:59.45,0:53:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, turn this castle into the greatest \Namusement park in the world!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:03.08,0:53:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,An amusement park?
Dialogue: 10,0:53:04.69,0:53:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:06.63,0:53:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes our fish party... {??????}　{パーティーはお流れに…}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:10.13,0:53:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's build a place where everybody \Ncan laugh and have fun together!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:15.34,0:53:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to work\N for everyone's sake, at least once.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:19.85,0:53:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Then let's go big! {probably both literally (big genie) and figuratively (as in dreaming big)}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:22.64,0:53:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:41.54,0:53:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:00.82,0:54:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Did you just yawn, little boy?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:03.39,0:54:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Feeling bored, little girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:05.47,0:54:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:06.78,0:54:10.16,Song,,0,0,0,,Come on over\NCome on over and play {lyrics from the booklet from the same auction: でおいでよ\Nあそびにおいでよ\N道はすぐにわかるさ\N雲がおしえてくれる\N風がおしえてくれる\N星がおしえてくれる\Nそこはいつも\Nきみたちのもの\N笑いだしたくなる\N「ペロペロキャンディー！」\Nうたいたくなる\N「メリーゴーランド！」\Nあばれたくなる\N「キャンプ・ファイヤー！」\Nそこはいつも\Nぼくたちのもの\Nヤホー\Nたのしくおどる\N}
Dialogue: 10,0:54:10.16,0:54:13.19,Song,,0,0,0,,You'll figure out the way right away
Dialogue: 10,0:54:13.19,0:54:16.37,Song,,0,0,0,,The clouds will show you
Dialogue: 10,0:54:16.37,0:54:19.49,Song,,0,0,0,,The wind will show you
Dialogue: 10,0:54:19.49,0:54:22.55,Song,,0,0,0,,The stars will show you
Dialogue: 10,0:54:25.86,0:54:27.95,Song,,0,0,0,,That place
Dialogue: 10,0:54:29.12,0:54:31.59,Song,,0,0,0,,Will always be yours
Dialogue: 10,0:54:32.29,0:54:35.85,Song,,0,0,0,,You'll feel like laughing
Dialogue: 10,0:54:38.64,0:54:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lollipops!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:40.40,0:54:42.95,Song,,0,0,0,,You'll feel like singing
Dialogue: 10,0:54:42.95,0:54:45.18,Song,,0,0,0,,{whoops}
Dialogue: 10,0:54:45.18,0:54:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Merry-go-round!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:46.94,0:54:48.86,Song,,0,0,0,,You'll feel like running wild
Dialogue: 10,0:54:51.61,0:54:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Campfire!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:53.15,0:54:57.73,Song,,0,0,0,,This place will always be ours!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:57.73,0:54:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:59.67,0:55:02.95,Song,,0,0,0,,Dance around \NDance and have fun
Dialogue: 10,0:55:02.95,0:55:06.05,Song,,0,0,0,,You'll figure out the way right away {repeats previous lines}
Dialogue: 10,0:55:06.05,0:55:09.27,Song,,0,0,0,,The clouds will show you
Dialogue: 10,0:55:09.27,0:55:12.47,Song,,0,0,0,,The wind will show you
Dialogue: 10,0:55:12.47,0:55:15.63,Song,,0,0,0,,The stars will show you
Dialogue: 10,0:55:15.63,0:55:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hup two! Hup two! Hup two! Hup two!
